==Battleground==
*1 [[Two Can]] spawns.
*1 [[Two Can]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Two Can]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Tackey]]s spawn, delay 40~50 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns.

==Strategy==
It is important to remember that every enemy here has the '''dark''' trait, so units like [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bomber Cat]] can work well to subdue the enemies while [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza]] demolishes them. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] can work well to help with stopping the Bun Bun Black while erasing the threat of the Two Cans, and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] can be used to do big damage before he dies.

The best way to approach this stage is to either stall or kill the Two Cans at the beginning of the stage without triggering the boss wave, as that allows for you to build up enough money to take on the threats, due to the lack of peons. Bun Bun Black will be the main pusher here, so bring anti Floating or anti Dark units to deal with him. Remember that Tackey exists, and losing ground will cause him to snipe and destroy your base, so you must maintain whatever ground you have at all costs.

Anti-Dark ubers, especially those from the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Vajiras]] banner, will shine here.

